@startuml
title Service Manager 本地服务生命周期

skinparam shadowing false

actor 用户 as User
participant "Renderer" as Renderer
participant "window.api.intel/system" as Api
participant "IPC Router" as Ipc
participant "Service Manager" as Manager
participant "Process Adapter" as Process
participant "local-intel Scripts" as Scripts
participant "Health Checker" as Health
database "App SQLite" as DB

User -> Renderer: 点击启动 local-intel
Renderer -> Api: startService()
Api -> Ipc: intel:service:start
Ipc -> Manager: start(local-intel)
Manager -> DB: 写入 starting 状态
Manager -> Process: 执行 start_local_intel.ps1
Process -> Scripts: 启动 web + scheduler
Scripts --> Process: 返回进程/日志信息
Manager -> Health: 检查端口、PID、状态脚本
Health --> Manager: running / degraded / error
Manager -> DB: 写入状态和错误摘要
Manager --> Ipc: ApiResult<ServiceStatus>
Ipc --> Api: 返回结果
Api --> Renderer: 更新页面状态
Renderer --> User: 展示运行状态

== 周期性健康检查 ==
Manager -> Health: poll()
Health --> Manager: 状态变化
Manager -> DB: 更新 ServiceStatus
Manager -> Renderer: service:event

== 停止服务 ==
User -> Renderer: 点击停止
Renderer -> Api: stopService()
Api -> Ipc: intel:service:stop
Ipc -> Manager: stop(local-intel)
Manager -> Process: 执行 stop_local_intel.ps1
Process -> Scripts: 停止服务
Manager -> Health: 确认停止
Manager -> DB: 写入 stopped 状态

@enduml
